    "detailed_description": "<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Overview</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >&quot;Rise of the Penguins&quot; is a 2D Side-Scrolling\u00a0 Action-Platformer for Gameboy. The game is meant to be simple and linear but with some challenging enemies. The game is inspired by ghost n goblins and a bit of mega man.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Features</strong></h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>6 levels</strong> with a variety of enemies in each level</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>2 Extra Levels</strong></p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Boss Rush Mode</strong>, Unlocked only after beating all 6 levels</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>6 mini boss</strong> enemies and <strong>8 boss</strong> enemies(including the 2 ks ones) and a <strong>final boss</strong></p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>6 simple difficulty settings</strong> to adjust checkpoints to make the game harder or easier, with checkpoints resetting after a game over but modifiable through these settings.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Basic hud</strong> that shows the highscore, health and time remaining</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Janky animations</strong> made by me</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Minimal story</strong> with no text -but hoping the game is engaging enough to keep playing</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p>",
    "about_the_game": "<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Overview</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >&quot;Rise of the Penguins&quot; is a 2D Side-Scrolling\u00a0 Action-Platformer for Gameboy. The game is meant to be simple and linear but with some challenging enemies. The game is inspired by ghost n goblins and a bit of mega man.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Features</strong></h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>6 levels</strong> with a variety of enemies in each level</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>2 Extra Levels</strong></p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Boss Rush Mode</strong>, Unlocked only after beating all 6 levels</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>6 mini boss</strong> enemies and <strong>8 boss</strong> enemies(including the 2 ks ones) and a <strong>final boss</strong></p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>6 simple difficulty settings</strong> to adjust checkpoints to make the game harder or easier, with checkpoints resetting after a game over but modifiable through these settings.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Basic hud</strong> that shows the highscore, health and time remaining</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Janky animations</strong> made by me</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Minimal story</strong> with no text -but hoping the game is engaging enough to keep playing</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p>",
